nvidia-settings 610.57.04 for the Gaming Live CD - the NVIDIA X Server
Settings control panel, split out of the main Nvidia driver package (Arch
"nvidia-settings").

Built from NVIDIA's standalone nvidia-settings source tarball, not from the
driver .run. It is a hand-rolled recursive Makefile project (no autotools
configure); PREFIX ?= /usr/local in utils.mk feeds BINDIR/LIBDIR/MANDIR, so
the recipe passes PREFIX=$target (and MANDIR, which utils.mk would otherwise
put under share/man/man1 where Gobo's man path never looks).

Installed to /Programs/Nvidia-Settings:
- bin/nvidia-settings  the control panel CLI + GUI
- lib/libnvidia-gtk2.so.<ver>, lib/libnvidia-gtk3.so.<ver>,
  lib/libnvidia-wayland-client.so.<ver>  helper libraries the panel dlopens
  for its GTK and Wayland code paths
- man/man1/nvidia-settings.1
- share/applications/nvidia-settings.desktop + share/pixmaps/nvidia-settings.png
  (the source tarball ships both WITHOUT them being installed by any make
  target, and with placeholder tokens; post_install substitutes __UTILS_PATH__
  with /Programs/Nvidia-Settings/Current/bin and __NVIDIA_SETTINGS_DESKTOP_CATEGORIES__
  with Settings;HardwareSettings;). They go into share/ -- not a "Shared/" dir --
  because SymlinkProgram links share/ into /System/Index/share, which is what
  puts the launcher in /usr/share/applications and the icon in
  /usr/share/pixmaps where "Icon=nvidia-settings" is looked up.

Dependencies: GTK+ (3.x), LibX11, LibXext, LibXxf86vm, Wayland. jansson is
bundled in the tarball (NV_USE_BUNDLED_LIBJANSSON ?= 1) so the system Jansson
is not needed.

Ownership: kernel modules, the Xorg DDX, nvidia-settings' runtime enablement
files and the GSP/ucode firmware come from the Nvidia recipe; the 64-bit/32-bit
libraries, tools, Vulkan ICDs and glvnd EGL vendor JSONs from Nvidia-Utils.
This recipe compiles nothing that needs the NVIDIA kernel sources - nvidia-settings
reaches the driver at runtime through the NVCtrl X extension the DDX provides.

Version: the rest of the stack is 615.71.09 while this is 610.57.04 (requested
that way). nvidia-settings-615.71.09.tar.bz2 exists upstream if a matched pair
is preferred later; the NVCtrl ABI is stable across these branches.
